This, of course, depends on your present stock of items and
intrinsics.  If you don't have magic resistance (and don't plan
on getting it soon) I suggest liches (L) or if your scroll is
not blessed, starting with master lich, then demi lich.  Without
magic resistance, they have a nasty way of making your armor
disappear forever.  I believe magic resistance prevents this
(please let me know if I'm wrong).  Getting magic resistance
is a must, however, if you plan on venturing into the mazes of
Hell.  Polymorphing a gray dragon corpse and wearing the resulting
armor will give you magic resistance.  I've also had a titan make
my armor go bye-bye, but when I tried to genocide titans, a thundering
voiced boomed, "That shall not be done, mortal!" or words to that 
effect.

